@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: Method / document navigation. Scope-independent process/navigation; provider or runner examples are not MVP prerequisites.
title Resumefolio | Specification working cycle
skinparam backgroundColor #101827
skinparam defaultFontColor #F1F5F9
skinparam hyperlinkColor #A9D0FF
skinparam dpi 216
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #9FB2CD
skinparam activity {
 BackgroundColor #1C3453
 BorderColor #9FB2CD
 FontColor #F1F5F9
 DiamondBackgroundColor #49351C
 DiamondBorderColor #F2BA72
 StartColor #F1F5F9
 EndColor #F1F5F9
}
start
:Select analyzed needs, sources and accepted scope;
:Choose authoritative domain record and shared rules;
repeat
 :Write obligation, context, rationale and actual status;
 :Define criteria, verification methods and evidence needs;
 :Link scenarios, data definitions, models and traceability;
 :Review statement quality and cross-record consistency;
 if (Missing evidence or material ambiguity?) then (yes)
  :Record questions, owner and dependent gate; <<#49351C>>
  :Return clarification to elicitation / analysis as needed;
 else (no known blocker)
  :Record actual review findings and dispositions;
 endif
repeat while (Further refinement needed before handoff?) is (yes) not (no)
:Prepare identified candidate for requirement review; <<#173B34>>
:Retain unresolved blockers and actual status;
:Record acceptance only after an actual owner decision;
stop
legend bottom
Candidate handoff is not M-02 acceptance or successful product verification.
Use the separate baseline checklist and preserve the wider pre-coding agreement.
Maintain source, requirement and future evidence links throughout change.
endlegend
@enduml
